<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Estratega de Lanzamientos O.A.E. — Descubre por qué tu curso no vende</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#0A0A0F; --bg-2:#0E0E16; --card:#14141E; --card-2:#1A1A26;
    --border:rgba(255,255,255,.07); --border-2:rgba(255,255,255,.12);
    --purple:#9B6CFF; --purple-2:#7C5CFC; --purple-lite:#C4A8FF;
    --grad:linear-gradient(135deg,#B57BFF 0%,#7C5CFC 100%);
    --txt:#F4F4F8; --muted:#9594A6; --muted-2:#6E6D7E;
    --green:#3FCF8E;
    --radius:16px;
    --font:'Plus Jakarta Sans',-apple-system,sans-serif;
  }
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
  body{font-family:var(--font);background:var(--bg);color:var(--txt);line-height:1.65;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow-x:hidden}
  h1,h2,h3{font-weight:800;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.02em}
  .wrap{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
  .narrow{max-width:780px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
  a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}
  .accent{background:var(--grad);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}

  /* ---- Buttons ---- */
  .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:var(--grad);color:#fff;font-family:var(--font);font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;padding:17px 38px;border-radius:60px;border:none;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .25s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1),box-shadow .25s;box-shadow:0 8px 34px rgba(124,92,252,.45)}
  .btn:hover{transform:translateY(-3px) scale(1.02);box-shadow:0 14px 46px rgba(124,92,252,.6)}
  .btn:active{transform:translateY(0) scale(.99)}
  .btn .arrow{transition:transform .25s}
  .btn:hover .arrow{transform:translateX(5px)}
  .btn-sm{padding:11px 24px;font-size:.9rem;box-shadow:0 6px 22px rgba(124,92,252,.4)}

  /* ---- Header ---- */
  header{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;padding:18px 0;transition:all .35s ease}
  header.scrolled{background:rgba(10,10,15,.85);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:11px 0}
  .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
  .logo{font-weight:800;font-size:1.3rem;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-.02em}
  .logo b{background:var(--grad);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}

  /* ---- Hero ---- */
  .hero{position:relative;padding:165px 0 90px;overflow:hidden;text-align:center}
  .hero::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:-15%;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:1000px;height:760px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse,rgba(124,92,252,.20) 0%,rgba(124,92,252,0) 62%);pointer-events:none}
  .dots{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0;pointer-events:none;background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.10) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:42px 42px;-webkit-mask:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 35%,#000 0%,transparent 70%);mask:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 35%,#000 0%,transparent 70%);opacity:.5}
  .hero .wrap{position:relative;z-index:2}
  .pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:.82rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--purple-lite);background:rgba(155,108,255,.10);border:1px solid rgba(155,108,255,.3);padding:8px 18px;border-radius:60px;margin-bottom:26px}
  .hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,6.2vw,4.4rem);color:#fff;max-width:16ch;margin:0 auto;letter-spacing:-.03em}
  .hero .sub{font-size:clamp(1.05rem,2vw,1.3rem);color:var(--muted);max-width:56ch;margin:24px auto 0;font-weight:400}
  .checks{display:inline-grid;gap:10px;margin:32px auto 36px;text-align:left}
  .checks li{list-style:none;display:flex;gap:11px;align-items:center;color:#D7D7E2;font-size:1.02rem;font-weight:500}
  .checks .ck{color:var(--purple);font-weight:800}
  .cta-row{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:14px}
  .micro{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
  .pill-2{font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--purple-lite);background:rgba(155,108,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(155,108,255,.25);padding:7px 16px;border-radius:60px}
  .rating{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;justify-content:center;margin-top:28px}
  .avs{display:flex}
  .avs span{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid var(--bg);margin-left:-10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700;color:#fff}
  .avs span:first-child{margin-left:0}
  .rating .stars{color:var(--purple-lite);letter-spacing:1px;font-size:.95rem}
  .rating small{color:var(--muted);font-size:.85rem;display:block}

  /* ---- Carousel (auto) ---- */
  .carousel-sec{padding:60px 0 80px}
  .carousel-sec .head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:40px}
  .carousel-sec h2{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,2.6rem);color:#fff}
  .carousel-sec p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px;font-size:1.05rem}
  .marquee{overflow:hidden;-webkit-mask:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#000 7%,#000 93%,transparent);mask:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#000 7%,#000 93%,transparent)}
  .marquee+.marquee{margin-top:20px}
  .track{display:flex;gap:20px;width:max-content;animation:scroll 45s linear infinite}
  .track.rev{animation-direction:reverse;animation-duration:55s}
  .marquee:hover .track{animation-play-state:paused}
  @keyframes scroll{to{transform:translateX(-50%)}}
  .slide{flex:0 0 auto;width:320px;height:200px;border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--border-2);background:var(--card);position:relative}
  .slide img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}
  .slide .ph{width:100%;height:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#16121F,#1C1630);color:var(--muted);font-size:.92rem;font-weight:600}
  .slide .ph .pi{font-size:1.6rem;color:var(--purple)}

  /* ---- Section base ---- */
  section{padding:92px 0}
  .eyebrow{font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--purple-lite);margin-bottom:14px;display:block;text-align:center}
  .sec-title{font-size:clamp(1.9rem,4.2vw,3rem);text-align:center;max-width:20ch;margin:0 auto 16px;color:#fff}
  .sec-lead{text-align:center;font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--muted);max-width:60ch;margin:0 auto 54px}

  .grid{display:grid;gap:20px}
  .g3{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
  .card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:32px 28px;transition:transform .35s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1),border-color .35s,background .35s}
  .card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);border-color:var(--border-2);background:var(--card-2)}
  .card .ic{font-size:1.7rem;margin-bottom:14px}
  .card h3{font-size:1.25rem;margin-bottom:8px;color:#fff}
  .card p{color:var(--muted);font-size:1rem;font-weight:400}

  /* ---- Pillars ---- */
  .pillars{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:22px}
  .pillar{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:36px 30px;transition:transform .35s,border-color .35s}
  .pillar:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);border-color:rgba(155,108,255,.5)}
  .pillar .letter{font-size:3.2rem;font-weight:800;line-height:1;background:var(--grad);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}
  .pillar h3{color:#fff;font-size:1.35rem;margin:8px 0 10px}
  .pillar p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.98rem;font-weight:400}

  /* ---- Steps ---- */
  .steps{counter-reset:s;display:grid;gap:18px;max-width:780px;margin:0 auto}
  .step{display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:flex-start;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:26px 30px;transition:transform .3s,border-color .3s}
  .step:hover{transform:translateX(6px);border-color:var(--border-2)}
  .step .num{counter-increment:s;flex:0 0 auto;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(155,108,255,.12);border:1px solid rgba(155,108,255,.35);color:var(--purple-lite);font-weight:800;font-size:1.25rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
  .step .num::before{content:counter(s)}
  .step h3{font-size:1.2rem;margin-bottom:4px;color:#fff}
  .step p{color:var(--muted);font-weight:400}

  /* ---- VS ---- */
  .vs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;max-width:840px;margin:0 auto}
  .vs .col{padding:34px 30px;border-radius:var(--radius);border:1px solid var(--border)}
  .vs .bad{background:var(--card)}
  .vs .good{background:linear-gradient(160deg,rgba(124,92,252,.12),var(--card));border:1px solid rgba(155,108,255,.4)}
  .vs h3{font-size:1.2rem;margin-bottom:18px;color:#fff}
  .vs ul{list-style:none}
  .vs li{padding:10px 0;font-size:.98rem;color:var(--muted);display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
  .vs li:last-child{border:none}
  .vs .good li{color:#DAD7E8}
  .mark{flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:800}
  .mark.x{color:#E2615B}.mark.c{color:var(--purple-lite)}

  /* ---- Features ---- */
  .feats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px 34px;max-width:860px;margin:0 auto}
  .feat{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start}
  .feat .fi{flex:0 0 auto;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:9px;background:rgba(155,108,255,.14);color:var(--purple-lite);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:800}
  .feat b{display:block;color:#fff;font-size:1.04rem}
  .feat span{color:var(--muted);font-size:.95rem;font-weight:400}

  /* ---- Testimonials ---- */
  .quote{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:30px 28px;transition:transform .35s,border-color .35s}
  .quote:hover{transform:translateY(-5px);border-color:var(--border-2)}
  .stars{color:var(--purple-lite);font-size:1rem;margin-bottom:12px;letter-spacing:2px}
  .quote p{font-size:1.02rem;color:#E4E3EC;margin-bottom:18px;font-weight:400}
  .who{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
  .who .av{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--grad);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700}
  .who b{font-size:.96rem;color:#fff}
  .who span{font-size:.84rem;color:var(--muted-2);display:block}

  /* ---- Offer ---- */
  .offer{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;background:linear-gradient(165deg,rgba(124,92,252,.14),var(--card));border:1px solid rgba(155,108,255,.4);border-radius:22px;padding:46px 42px;text-align:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
  .offer::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:-40%;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:520px;height:520px;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(155,108,255,.18),transparent 60%)}
  .offer>*{position:relative;z-index:2}
  .badge{display:inline-block;background:var(--grad);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:7px 16px;border-radius:60px;margin-bottom:20px}
  .offer h3{color:#fff;font-size:1.6rem;margin-bottom:14px}
  .price{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:center;gap:14px;margin:16px 0 6px}
  .price .cur{font-size:1.3rem;color:var(--purple-lite);align-self:flex-start;margin-top:8px}
  .price .now{font-size:4rem;font-weight:800;background:var(--grad);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;letter-spacing:-.03em}
  .price .was{font-size:1.4rem;color:var(--muted-2);text-decoration:line-through}
  .once{color:var(--muted);font-size:.95rem;margin-bottom:26px}
  .incl{text-align:left;max-width:380px;margin:0 auto 30px;display:grid;gap:11px}
  .incl li{list-style:none;display:flex;gap:11px;color:#DAD7E8;font-size:1rem}
  .incl .c{color:var(--purple-lite);font-weight:800;flex:0 0 auto}
  .offer .btn{width:100%;justify-content:center;font-size:1.12rem}

  .guarantee{max-width:720px;margin:46px auto 0;display:flex;gap:26px;align-items:center;background:rgba(155,108,255,.06);border:1px solid rgba(155,108,255,.22);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:26px 30px}
  .seal{flex:0 0 auto;width:82px;height:82px;border-radius:50%;border:2px dashed var(--purple);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;font-weight:800;color:var(--purple-lite);font-size:.76rem;line-height:1.15}
  .guarantee h3{color:#fff;font-size:1.15rem;margin-bottom:6px}
  .guarantee p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.96rem;font-weight:400}

  /* ---- FAQ ---- */
  .faq{max-width:760px;margin:46px auto 0;display:grid;gap:13px}
  .q{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden}
  .q button{width:100%;text-align:left;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;padding:23px 26px;font-family:var(--font);font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem;color:#fff;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px}
  .q .plus{flex:0 0 auto;font-size:1.5rem;color:var(--purple-lite);transition:transform .3s;line-height:1}
  .q.open .plus{transform:rotate(45deg)}
  .q .ans{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .4s ease}
  .q .ans p{padding:0 26px 24px;color:var(--muted);font-size:1rem;font-weight:400}

  /* ---- Final ---- */
  .final{text-align:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
  .final::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:50%;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:780px;height:600px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse,rgba(124,92,252,.16),transparent 62%)}
  .final .narrow{position:relative;z-index:2}
  .final h2{font-size:clamp(2.1rem,5vw,3.4rem);color:#fff;margin-bottom:18px}
  .final p{color:var(--muted);font-size:1.12rem;max-width:50ch;margin:0 auto 34px;font-weight:400}

  footer{border-top:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--muted-2);text-align:center;padding:38px 24px;font-size:.85rem}
  footer .logo{font-size:1.05rem;margin-bottom:10px;display:inline-block}

  /* ---- Reveal ---- */
  .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px);transition:opacity .8s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1),transform .8s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1)}
  .reveal.in{opacity:1;transform:none}
  .d1{transition-delay:.08s}.d2{transition-delay:.16s}.d3{transition-delay:.24s}.d4{transition-delay:.32s}
  .hero .anim{opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px);animation:rise .9s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1) forwards}
  .hero .a1{animation-delay:.1s}.hero .a2{animation-delay:.26s}.hero .a3{animation-delay:.42s}.hero .a4{animation-delay:.58s}.hero .a5{animation-delay:.74s}
  @keyframes rise{to{opacity:1;transform:none}}

  @media(max-width:820px){
    .g3,.pillars,.feats,.vs{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    section{padding:68px 0}
    .guarantee{flex-direction:column;text-align:center}
    header .btn{display:none}
    header.scrolled .btn{display:inline-flex}
    .slide{width:260px;height:165px}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ============ HEADER ============ -->
<header id="hdr">
  <div class="wrap nav">
    <div class="logo">Estratega <b>O.A.E.</b></div>
    <a href="#TU-ENLACE-DE-COMPRA" class="btn btn-sm">Empezar ahora</a>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="dots"></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="pill anim a1">✦ Para coaches e infoproductores</span>
    <h1 class="anim a2">Descubre por qué tu curso <span class="accent">no vende</span> (y arréglalo)</h1>
    <p class="sub anim a3">Tu estratega de lanzamientos personal con el Método O.A.E. Encuentra en minutos el bloqueo real que frena tus ventas y recibe el plan exacto para resolverlo.</p>
    <ul class="checks anim a3">
      <li><span class="ck">✓</span> Diagnóstico en menos de 5 minutos</li>
      <li><span class="ck">✓</span> Método probado por los mejores del marketing</li>
      <li><span class="ck">✓</span> Plan de acción concreto, paso a paso</li>
      <li><span class="ck">✓</span> Disponible 24/7, las veces que quieras</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="cta-row anim a4">
      <a href="#TU-ENLACE-DE-COMPRA" class="btn">Quiero mi diagnóstico <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
